From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Bridge delivery: new shop services, check command, admin editor

Adds typed group_grant / group_revoke / kit_credit helpers, server CSV
scope, package bridge dispatcher, dry-run artisan command, deliveries
editor partial, and unit tests. Kit credits never expire.

